# Session signing keys.
#
# `grantEngagement` generates a signer per engagement and persists its key here,
# because a session whose key exists only in memory becomes, after a restart,
# live authority on chain with no off switch. That makes this directory the most
# dangerous thing in the working tree: 0600 on disk, and never in a commit.
.sessions/
*.key
.vercel
.env*
